      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "被净化的敌人会转为同伴力量，跑局材料还能用于永久强化和制作新装备",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your abilities are limited on their own, but you can make use of the power of your foes-returned-friends! Use materials obtained from runs to increase your strength and craft new equipment, preparing you for greater challenges ahead!",
