      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "首领连战、无尽神社扫荡与高难附加关卡分别提供纯首领、群怪和技巧试炼",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Take on boss battle after boss battle in Boss Rush, or endless waves of enemies in Shrine Sweep! Optional Extra Stages are also available as high difficulty trials; currently two, with more in store for the future!",
